Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The legacy public.universities table was dropped on 2026-05-10 (db
migration 20260510130000_uni_db_v3_drop_legacy_universities.sql).
This patch swings the React staff CRM to read/write public.institutions
(uni_db) instead.

Companion DB migrations (already applied to staging+prod from the
hanguk_app worktree, NOT this repo):
  - 20260510130000_uni_db_v3_drop_legacy_universities.sql
      forensic backup, drop 20 FK constraints, delete fake test
      rows from applications, NULL FK columns elsewhere, drop
      public.universities + 5 unused tables (university_admissions,
      _announcements, _events, _notes, _staff_assignments), drop
      legacy_compat fns.
  - 20260510130100_uni_db_v3_rename_to_institution_id.sql
      rename university_id -> institution_id (and target_university_id
      -> target_institution_id) on every kept table, add new FKs to
      public.institutions(id) ON DELETE SET NULL, recreate the
      room_members RLS policy against the new column names.

What this CRM patch does:

* Bulk-renames university_id -> institution_id and
  target_university_id -> target_institution_id across .ts/.tsx
  (30 files).
* Bulk-renames .from('universities') -> .from('institutions')
  and embed-relation 'university:universities(...)' ->
  'university:institutions(...)' across the entire src/.
* src/hooks/useUniversities.ts is rewritten to query institutions
  (with a back-compat 'University' type alias). Old hook name is
  kept so existing call sites keep working.
* src/components/crm/pages/UniversitiesContent.tsx is replaced
  with a clean ~340-line page: search, partner toggle, map-visibility
  toggle, add/edit/delete dialogs, all against institutions. Stats
  cards reflect the new schema (total / partners / on_map / with_domain
  / with_geo).
* The 4 legacy components in src/components/universities/ are
  deleted (UniversityList, UniversityForm, UniversityDetailSheet,
  AIUniversityForm — sole consumer was UniversitiesContent).
* src/lib/api/koreanUniversities.ts is neutered: every export
  throws a controlled 'retired 2026-05-10' error, so a stray
  click on an old bulk-import button surfaces a toast instead of
  a 500.
* Dropped-table queries (useUniversityAnnouncements,
  useUniversityEvents, useUniversityStaffData) are stubbed to
  return empty data / no-op writes.
* Surgical fixes for queries that selected legacy-only columns:
  KakaoMap, useReports, useSystemHealth, useProgramSearch,
  StaffDetail, NewSessionDialog, useCRMData, StudentDataContext
  (drop name_uz / city_en / city_uz / city_ru / ranking / website
  refs; substitute name_en / name_ko / city_ko / tier /
  primary_admissions_url_ko / order-by-tier).
* applicationForms.ts: tuition_min/max writes are skipped (those
  columns moved out of institutions into public.tuition); just
  touch updated_at.
* StudentDetail.tsx applications-with-uni nested select now
  hints !applications_institution_id_fkey + selects name_ko
  instead of name_uz.

Known follow-ups (Phase 3R-C):

* src/integrations/supabase/types.ts is intentionally NOT regenerated
  — it still defines a Tables<'universities'> shape that's now a
  type-only fiction. After this lands, run
    npx supabase gen types typescript --linked > src/integrations/supabase/types.ts
  and fix whatever student-side components break (most will be
  trivial: name_uz -> name_en/ko; city_en -> city_ko).
* Many student-side components (UniversityMapKakao, ScholarshipCard,
  ProgramCard, TranslationPanel etc.) still read .name_uz at
  runtime — those return undefined now and the UI shows blanks.
  Acceptable for cutover (no active users; counselor team rebuilds
  the per-locale shell in Phase 3R-C).
* AI-driven 'Add university by name' flow is intentionally hidden;
  re-implement against institutions + recruitment_units later.
* Bulk import of Korean universities is intentionally hidden;
  the discovery worker (services/uni_db) is the canonical path now.

Verification still pending:
  Local npm install / vite build kept timing out in the build
  sandbox, so this hasn't been compile-verified locally. Smoke
  test on a Vercel preview before merging to hanguk-uz main.
